        },
        {
          "text": "Lesinye isithunywa futhi saphuma sivela ealtareni, silamandla phezu komlilo, samemeza ngelizwi elikhulu kuso esilesikela ebukhali sisithi: Sebenzisa isikela yakho ebukhali, ubuthelele iziswenya zevini lomhlaba, ngoba izithelo zalo sezivuthiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
