              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isithunywa sayiphosa isikela yaso emhlabeni, salivuna ivini lomhlaba, saliphosela esikhamelweni sewayini esikhulu solaka lukaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
